---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Your account" description="Your saved BIS plans and talent builds on Forever XP." noindex>
  <h1>Your account</h1>
  <div id="acct-page">
    <p class="muted" data-state>Checking whether you're signed in…</p>

    <section data-signed-in hidden>
      <p>Signed in with Discord as <b data-name></b>. We keep your Discord user ID, this name and the plans you save. Nothing else.</p>
      <h2>My scouting</h2>
      <p class="muted small">Link a <a href="/scout/">ForeverScout</a> install to show your Discord name on the <a href="/leaderboard/">leaderboard</a>. Only linked scouts are listed there; your logs improve the site's routes and drops either way. We store a one-way hash of the install, never the install itself.</p>
      <div class="claimbox" data-pending hidden>
        <p>Link <b data-pending-handle></b> to your account? The leaderboard will show your Discord name unless you pick another.</p>
        <p><label>Name on the board (optional) <input type="text" data-pending-name maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Use my Discord name" /></label></p>
        <p class="actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-link>Link it</button> <button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-skip>Not now</button></p>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" data-scout-empty hidden>No ForeverScout installs linked yet. The uploader opens this page for you after setup; the link is also saved as <code>claim.txt</code> next to its log.</p>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table data-scout-table hidden>
          <thead><tr><th>Install</th><th>Shown as</th><th>Name</th><th>On board</th><th></th></tr></thead>
          <tbody data-scouts></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <h2>Saved plans</h2>
      <p class="muted" data-empty hidden>Nothing saved yet. Use <b>Save to my account</b> in the <a href="/bis/">BIS planner</a> or a <a href="/talents/">talent calculator</a>.</p>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table data-table hidden>
          <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Kind</th><th>Saved</th><th></th></tr></thead>
          <tbody data-plans></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <h2>Account</h2>
      <p class="actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-signout>Sign out</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn danger" data-delete>Delete my account</button>
      </p>
      <p class="small muted" data-delete-note hidden>This removes your account, your sessions and every saved plan, right away. Click <b>Delete everything</b> to confirm.</p>
    </section>

    <section data-signed-out hidden>
      <p class="claimnote" data-claim-note hidden><b>One more step:</b> sign in with Discord to link your ForeverScout install and get your name on the leaderboard.</p>
      <p>Sign in with Discord to keep your BIS plans and talent builds on any device, and to put your name on the <a href="/leaderboard/">scout leaderboard</a>. We only ask Discord for your user ID and name.</p>
      <form method="post" action="/api/auth/login">
        <input type="hidden" name="return" value="/account/" />
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Sign in with Discord</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
<script>import "../scripts/accountpage.ts";</script>

<style>
  #acct-page .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #acct-page .btn.danger { background: var(--skip); color: #fff; border-color: var(--skip); }
  #acct-page .claimbox, #acct-page .claimnote { padding: 0.8rem 1rem; max-width: 60ch; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--xp); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--raise); }
  #acct-page .claimbox p { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  #acct-page input[type="text"] { font: inherit; padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); color: inherit; max-width: 14rem; }
  #acct-page td.kind { color: var(--muted); }
  #acct-page td.when { color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  #acct-page button.link { background: none; border: 0; color: var(--skip); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
